# FTP host profiles for Wren/3270
# Format: id, name, host/IP, port, user, secure
#   secure: none | explicit | implicit  (AUTH TLS / implicit TLS on connect, default none)
# Password is prompted at connect time — never stored here.
#
# Examples:
# mock-as400, Mock IBM i FTP,          mock-as400, 2121, qsecofr, explicit
# prod-uss,   z/OS USS Production,     10.0.0.5,   21,   ftpuser, explicit
